{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUT THAT WIRE: 4 Hostages in a Room and Boom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Cut That Wire</strong>, where every action you take, every game you play, and every wire you cut can lead to instant death. It\u2019s a game of deception and survival! Team up with an <strong>Engineer</strong>, avoid the <strong>dead wire</strong>, and eliminate the <strong>Imposter</strong>, or be the last survivor. Immerse yourself in this thrilling first-person multiplayer game where bluffing and bombs are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/a5348a5cddea949aabbff6e6c03ad370.poster.avif?t=1761821466\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/a5348a5cddea949aabbff6e6c03ad370.webm?t=1761821466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cut That Wire to Survive or Instantly Die!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Four wires, with one that leads to instant death.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with the games <strong>while spotting the odd behavior from your friend</strong>. An engineer can help avoid the deadly wire, but the imposter does the opposite. If you are having trust issues, this is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/aee2037286fdcedbe75818ecde216ef2.poster.avif?t=1761821466\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/aee2037286fdcedbe75818ecde216ef2.webm?t=1761821466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG BLUFF Games for \u2026 all bluffers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Play Bluff Games that make your heart skip a beat.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through the games that turn situations more chaotic. It\u2019s your choice, either using skill or bluffing to outsmart your friend. But remember, losers may risk cutting that wire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/b4206d513a4f8395c49cad31e136c8c0.poster.avif?t=1761821466\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/b4206d513a4f8395c49cad31e136c8c0.webm?t=1761821466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Steps to win : Play Games - Discuss - Vote - Cut - Survive or die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Escape the table of death by voting for the imposter.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to spot and vote the imposter to increase chances of winning, but it\u2019s hard to trust someone here. Team up with your friend, win the game and eliminate the imposter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/e155f399fd442db496f66688c22f28ae.poster.avif?t=1761821466\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/e155f399fd442db496f66688c22f28ae.webm?t=1761821466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please be reminded that time is counting.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The imposter may try to waste time and let the bomb go off.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t waste your time arguing for too long. Timebomb is counting. Survive before the bomb runs off or instantly dies.<br><br>Note :\u00a0The game requires 4 players to start.<br><br>&quot;After Bluffing in this game, I have trust issues. My friends left me. The game is so great 10/10 - Dr. Pawcho&quot;    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/da54be8410b7ac5b4b4b8e5399251e3e.avif?t=1761821466\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498650?t=1761821466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/d13353ad7aeb7ace0f3b20c7c25d38bea745eb12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761821466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/f09740ea0996ed3174d684d79e66117827043228/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761821466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/f09740ea0996ed3174d684d79e66117827043228/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761821466","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features cartoonish comedic violence and dark humor related to bomb defusal. Players may encounter scenes where characters are tied up, tricked, or \u2018exploded\u2019 in an exaggerated slapstick style. There is no sexual content or drug use. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUT THAT WIRE: 4 Hostages in a Room and Boom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_